# EventEase Cloud Migration

## Student Details

Name: Dhanusha Ramthoola
Student Number: [Your Student Number]

## Project Description

EventEase is an ASP.NET Core MVC web application used to manage events, venues and event types.

The application has been migrated from Local SQL Server to Microsoft Azure SQL Database.

## Technologies Used

- ASP.NET Core MVC
- Entity Framework Core
- Azure SQL Database
- Azure Resource Groups
- Azure SQL Server
- Azure Portal
- Visual Studio 2022

## Azure Resources

Resource Group:
EventEaseRG

SQL Server:
eventease-vithal

Database:
EventEaseRG

Region:
South Africa North

## Setup Instructions

1. Clone repository.
2. Open solution in Visual Studio.
3. Update connection string in appsettings.json.
4. Run:

```powershell
Update-Database


